    "value": {
      "id": 90467,
      "0": "Frost-rimed edges bite into the air, radiating a chill that numbs the arm. This great slab of pale metal stands firm against the heaviest impact, leaving the one behind it unshaken by the crushing weight of a foe's strike."
    }
