  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Scratches and jagged gouges mar the pale surface of this wide shield, showing where it has parried countless blows. The iron rim is pitted with age, yet it remains sturdy and reliable in a defender's grip."
    }
